Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.96,0:08:10.26,ep10 ch,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}我不能放弃我的目标与梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.93,0:08:17.85,ep10 ch,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}我倾尽所有 只为待在这座城市
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.10,0:08:21.56,ep10 ch,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}我的身体与心灵都在此处
Comment: 0,0:13:50.05,0:13:50.10,ep3 eng,,0,0,0,,12.49-13.36
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.73,0:12:54.39,ep3 eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}It's easy to feel invisible, in the haze of buildings,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.39,0:12:56.42,ep3 eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}people everywhere
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.43,0:12:59.18,ep3 eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}The streets don't feel livable,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.35,0:13:03.49,ep3 eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}but you can change the atmosphere
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.49,0:13:09.96,ep3 eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}We gotta find a new attitude, if you wanna make it out
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.39,0:13:12.66,ep3 eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}Caught up in the big time,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.68,0:13:16.60,ep3 eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}step out of line, on your own
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.21,0:13:19.57,ep3 eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}Go beyond the stratosphere,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.60,0:13:23.73,ep3 eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}we can get there, disappear
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.65,0:13:27.18,ep3 eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}We gotta find a way
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.07,0:13:30.68,ep3 eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}We gotta find a way out
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.55,0:13:34.17,ep3 eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}We gotta find a way
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.95,0:13:37.72,ep3 eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}We gotta find a way out
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.73,0:12:54.39,ep10 ch,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}建筑物笼罩之下隐去身形看似轻而易举
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.39,0:12:56.42,ep10 ch,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}在这人潮涌动中
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.43,0:12:59.18,ep10 ch,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}这街道不再宜居
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.35,0:13:03.49,ep10 ch,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}但你也可改变这「大气」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.49,0:13:09.96,ep10 ch,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}若想找到出路 不妨换一种态度
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.39,0:13:12.66,ep10 ch,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}置身于一流团队
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.68,0:13:16.60,ep10 ch,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}只身一人举止怪异
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.21,0:13:19.57,ep10 ch,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}超越极限吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.60,0:13:23.73,ep10 ch,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}我们可抵达而后隐去身形
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.65,0:13:27.18,ep10 ch,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}我们将寻得道路
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.07,0:13:30.68,ep10 ch,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}我们将找到出路
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.55,0:13:34.17,ep10 ch,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}我们将寻得道路
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.95,0:13:37.72,ep10 ch,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}我们将找到出路
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,ep3 eng,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.45,0:20:31.83,ep3 eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}Perdue dans mes pensées
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.33,0:20:36.38,ep3 eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}Tant de chemins à emprunter
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.84,0:20:40.76,ep3 eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}Comment changer, comment grandir?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.01,0:20:45.97,ep3 eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}Ou comment savoir ce que je désire?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.18,0:20:49.81,ep3 eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}Je change toujours d'avis
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.85,0:20:54.31,ep3 eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}Je n'attendrai pas toute ma vie
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.02,0:20:58.61,ep3 eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}C'est mon coeur qui me guide
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.78,0:21:03.74,ep3 eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}Mais qui sait vraiment où je vais finir?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.03,0:21:08.20,ep3 eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}Là-bas dans mes rêves
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.45,0:21:12.58,ep3 eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}J'ai vu l'avenir
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.91,0:21:17.13,ep3 eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}Vision onirique
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.38,0:21:21.76,ep3 eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}D'une vie magique
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.18,0:21:29.60,ep3 eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}Toutes ces pensées me hantent
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.81,0:21:34.06,ep3 eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}Quelle pourrait bien être l'étape suivante
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.77,0:21:38.48,ep3 eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}Pour certains c'est une aubaine
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.65,0:21:43.65,ep3 eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}Mais alors pourquoi suis-je si incertaine?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.99,0:21:47.66,ep3 eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}Perdue dans mes pensées
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.82,0:21:52.08,ep3 eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}Tant de chemins à emprunter
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.29,0:21:56.29,ep3 eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}Comment changer, comment grandir?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.46,0:22:02.76,ep3 eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}Ou comment savoir ce que je désire
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,ep3 eng,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.45,0:20:31.83,ep10 ch,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}迷失自我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.33,0:20:36.38,ep10 ch,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}茫然不知方向
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.84,0:20:40.76,ep10 ch,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}如何改变自我 又该如何成长
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.01,0:20:45.97,ep10 ch,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}我又该怎样知晓自身渴望何在
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.18,0:20:49.81,ep10 ch,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}我总是举棋不定
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.85,0:20:54.31,ep10 ch,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}不能再止步不前
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.02,0:20:58.61,ep10 ch,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}我将随心而行
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.78,0:21:03.74,ep10 ch,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}但谁又明了我目的何在
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.03,0:21:08.20,ep10 ch,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}在我梦中
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.45,0:21:12.58,ep10 ch,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}我遇见未来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.91,0:21:17.13,ep10 ch,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}这愿景如梦似幻
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.38,0:21:21.76,ep10 ch,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}这生活宛如魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.18,0:21:29.60,ep10 ch,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}思绪萦绕于心头
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.81,0:21:34.06,ep10 ch,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}我又将走向何方是好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.77,0:21:38.48,ep10 ch,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}于他人而言此或甚好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.65,0:21:43.65,ep10 ch,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}为何我却如此忐忑
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.99,0:21:47.66,ep10 ch,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}迷失自我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.82,0:21:52.08,ep10 ch,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}茫然不知方向
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.29,0:21:56.29,ep10 ch,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}如何改变自我 又该如何成长
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.46,0:22:02.76,ep10 ch,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\bord4)}我又该怎样知晓自身渴望何在
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,ep3 eng,,0,0,0,,
